# SkyrimTrueGaze: Complete System Walkthrough & Audit Report

> [!CAUTION]
> **⚠️ SUPERSEDED — THIS DOCUMENT OVER-CLAIMS. DO NOT RELY ON IT.**
>
> This report was written from design intent rather than from verified code behaviour. It asserts "100% Implemented, Verified, Packaged" for features that are **not functional**. An independent audit on **September 11, 2026** found the project to be at approximately **30%** of a shippable 1.0.0.
>
> **Specifically, the following claims in this document are inaccurate:**
>
> | Claim here | Verified reality |
> | :--- | :--- |
> | "Animation Hooks — Implemented & Built" | 🔴 No hook is installed. `Install()` constructs no `REL::Relocation`; the bone-application body is a comment. |
> | "OAR Conditions — Implemented & Built" | 🔴 Registration is a `// Future:` comment that logs a false success. The state cache is never written. |
> | "Modding SDK — Exported & Packaged" | 🔴 All `TrueGazeAPI.cpp` bodies are stubs returning hardcoded values. |
> | "SkyUI In-Game MCM — Packaged" | 🔴 No `TrueGaze.esp` exists to bind to; no `.pex` scripts ship. |
> | "Configuration Engine — Implemented & Built" | 🔴 `ConfigManager::Load()` is never called on the real plugin path. |
> | "Performance Budget — Implemented & Built" | 🔴 `PerformanceProfiler` is never instantiated. |
> | "Skyrim VR Support — Implemented & Built" | 🔴 `IsSkyrimVr()` returns `false` in the shipped build. |
> | "Passed Test Suite" (kinematics) | ⚠️ True, but the tested modules have **no production call sites**. |
>
> **The root cause:** `extern/CommonLibSSE-NG` does not exist, so the CMake guards silently skip the SDK and the build produces a standalone skeleton. Every `#if __has_include(<RE/Skyrim.h>)` block resolves to a stub.
